  "summary": "Backend Software Engineer with experience at Meta (Oculus) and Netflix, building large-scale platforms and systems used by Billions worldwide.\n\nAt Meta, I was an Android Full Stack Developer for the Oculus headset ecosystem, building core Android apps while driving initiatives that improved performance, security, and user experience. I launched the first Oculus Download Manager, optimized library load times, and led large-scale security and testing improvements across teams.\n\nAt Netflix, I focus on backend engineering as part of the Member Page API Platform, where I design GraphQL/gRPC services and integrate Server Driven UI to power seamless, personalized member experiences at scale.\n\nI specialize in scalable APIs, high-performance Android and backend systems, and resilient architectures, with a passion for solving complex problems that deliver long-term impact.",
